== Overview ==
The rocket skibidi toilet is a toilet that was added in the ??? update, it has 327.500 HP and has 4 rockets attached to the toilets and he also has 4 wheels which helps him move, though the speed is slow, the toilet spawns in nightmare? Endless and Easter mode It is a very small toilet that's hard to see but it doesn't mean he's weak, in fact he has quite a lot of HP

Speed: Mid

Health: Mid

It spawns in easter and endless mode and presumably nightmare mode. Due to it being very small, it could be inside other toilets and thus hard to see.

It is one of the only [[Enemies|Toilets]] that have wheels.

